      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "see @{6075605abff0176ab3cf79ee|full_name} you do not own the group, and so you do not own the moderation of that group instance... so therefore you cannot impose your moderation on that group... this is called being power hungry, obsessive, and a control freak... i have told you before and i will tell you again, Group owners are \"on par\" with world owners, and Group admin/moderators are \"on par\" with world admin/moderators... get your ego under control Milo and stop acting like Putin. This so called \"trial\" is only going to look in \"your favor\" because you are not including people you have \"banned\" which are still a part of the ToS community. The figures of a \"yesman\" policy are always ascew because the only thing he hears is \"i agree with you\"...",
