      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df01005d81e144a793b84e|full_name}:\n\nReally should keep drama and personal issues out of the canny comments. Let's please keep this civil and constructive.\n\nBut you are correct that world creator doesn't have authority over non-public instances. VRChat has publicly stated that instance owner has higher authority over their instance than the world creator. The world creator is just the fallback for instances that don't have an actual owner, meaning that they are the owner of normal public instances.\n\nJust hoping that, at the very least, VRChat will remove the world creator's moderation powers in instances that aren't normal public instances.",
