  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-07-05T06:12:44.770Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "World creators are not able to join their own world if a group instance has the creator banned. This is similar to the problem of creators not being allowed to join private instances, but these are public group instances, meaning creators aren't even allowed to join public instances.\n\nThis is especially abused since in my situation, the group has been targeting me and the game's community since its release, and intentionally has me and the game's staff from being able to enter the world and moderate it.\n\nIncidents like these make moderation tools even more essential: https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/moderation-tools-for-world-creators",
